      <h2>5 Zero-Cost Inbound Funnels You Can Launch Today</h2>

      <h3>1. Website Floating Chat Widget</h3>
      <p>Rather than making visitors fill out multi-step contact forms that get abandoned, install a floating WhatsApp icon on your website. When clicked, it opens a conversation with a pre-filled message like: <em>"Hi, I am looking at [Product Page] and have a question."</em> This immediately qualifies high-intent shoppers while they browse.</p>

      <h3>2. Social Media Bio Links (Instagram, TikTok & LinkedIn)</h3>
      <p>Traffic from Instagram Reels and TikTok has short attention spans. Replace generic link-in-bio aggregators with a direct WhatsApp short link created on <a href="/blog/whatsapp-link-tiktok-bio">LinkWA</a>. Visitors connect directly with a sales specialist in a single tap.</p>

      <h3>3. Google Business Profile & Local SEO</h3>
      <p>Local customers searching for <em>"plumber near me"</em> or <em>"gym open now"</em> want answers immediately without dialling an unanswered phone line. Add a WhatsApp click-to-chat URL to your Google Maps listing under the secondary website or booking button to capture neighborhood leads.</p>

      <h3>4. Acrylic Counter Standees with Branded QR Codes</h3>
      <p>Transform physical footfall into ongoing digital subscribers by placing an attractive acrylic standee on your billing desk. Learn how in our <a href="/blog/whatsapp-group-qr-code-standee-guide">WhatsApp QR Standee Guide</a>.</p>

      <h3>5. Click-to-WhatsApp Ads with UTM Tracking</h3>
      <p>When running Meta (Facebook & Instagram) ads, configure the destination as a click-to-WhatsApp conversation. Attach custom UTM parameters using <a href="/blog/utm-tracking-whatsapp">LinkWA's UTM Builder</a> to track campaign, ad set, and creative performance without paying third-party SaaS tracking fees.</p>

