      <ol>
        <li><strong>Respond in Under 5 Minutes:</strong> Inbound leads are hottest the moment they hit "Send". A response within 3 minutes results in a 391% higher close rate compared to an hour later.</li>
        <li><strong>Set Up WhatsApp Business Auto-Replies:</strong> Use our <a href="/blog/whatsapp-business-auto-reply-message-samples">35+ proven auto-reply templates</a> to acknowledge inquiries instantly when your team is away.</li>
