      </ol>

      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <h3>Does Meta charge for chats opened via the WhatsApp Business App?</h3>
      <p>No. Standard one-to-one chats conducted via the free WhatsApp Business app on iOS and Android do not incur per-message fees from Meta. Pricing fees apply exclusively to the enterprise WhatsApp Cloud API.</p>

      <h3>Can I automate my inbound WhatsApp chats without API fees?</h3>
